# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# .ponsignore — explicit scope exclusions for pons-asinorum scans.
#
# Every line is a scope decision with a reason, in the open. Pons reports
# ignored subtrees as skips, so this file narrows the scan visibly; it must
# never grow to hide a finding class (that is what scoped, expiring
# suppressions in pons.toml are for).
#
# Historical record: retained verbatim, not maintained code. Findings here
# would describe the past, and "fixing" them would falsify it.
9-archive/
# Vendored satellite trees carry other projects' example code (the same
# reason Hypatia baselines them as tracked debt, standards#493).
rhodium-standard-repositories/
9-archive/rhodium-standard-repositories/
# Generated site output, not source.
www/
